# Edit a frame
Open the frame, edit its pixels and commit the result. All three operations come from canvas.

```ts
import { open, mapPixels, commit } from "canvas";
commit(mapPixels(open(bytes)));
```

The example uses a two-pixel frame.

Reviewed import paths and their exports (other paths were not inspected):
canvas: mapPixels, open
canvas/filters: blur, commit
